<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61817" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπά̆δ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>torch-bearing</i>, epith. of the moon-goddess, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.2557
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of a torch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					1.18
				</span></i>
			 codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπᾰδ-ιστής</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ,
				<i>runner in torch-race</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κοινὸν τῶν λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1068.2
				</span></i>
			 (Patmos, <span class="entity">iii/ii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				671
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				10
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>); subject of painting by
			Pyrrho, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				9.62
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἀγών,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαμπαδηφορία</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				131
			</span></i>.</div>
